sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户
  participant W as 提交用例
  participant C as ContentApi
  participant G as GovernanceApi
  participant DB as MySQL
  U->>W: 提交 noteId / version / key
  W->>DB: BEGIN + 校验幂等
  W->>C: 校验完整性并改PENDING
  C->>DB: 更新note/version
  W->>G: 创建同revision审核任务
  G->>DB: 插入唯一review
  W->>DB: 写outbox/command并COMMIT
  W->>U: 返回PENDING
